## Reused example code

MyGo's repository ships runnable examples and documentation demos under the
MIT License. Source files in this project that adapt such code carry a header
comment naming the upstream path and the MIT attribution
(`Adapted from github.com/egoist/mygo (MIT) — <path>`). No such files exist
yet as of Phase 1.1.0; this section is kept current as pages are added.

## App icon

`app/resources/icon.png` is the placeholder icon generated by `mygo init`
(MyGo CLI, MIT). It is replaced by the project's own brand icon in Phase 1.10.1.
